      "section_id": "why_mars",
      "title_zh": "为什么选择火星",
      "title_en": "Why Mars",
      "content_zh": "火星殖民是确保人类文明长期存续的关键。地球面临小行星撞击、核战争、气候变化、流行病、AI失控等威胁。火星是太阳系内最适合人类殖民的行星，一天长度与地球相近，存在水冰，二氧化碳大气可用于制造燃料和氧气。",
      "content_en": "Mars colonization is essential for ensuring the long-term survival of human civilization. Earth faces threats including asteroid impacts, nuclear war, climate change, pandemics, and AI失控. Mars is the most suitable planet for human colonization in the solar system, with a day length similar to Earth, water ice, and a CO2 atmosphere that can be used to produce fuel and oxygen."
    },
